{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world with breakbeats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, he is a superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in his true form, he is an up-and-coming DJ who keeps the clubs lively night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His name is BrebeMan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, he plays breakbeats from two records and defends the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, he never misses to proselytize breakbeat sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish this game, you will be hooked on breakbeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the true music game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BrebeMan&quot; is a 3D SHMUPS &amp; music game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the superhero \u201cBrebeMan\u201d and defeat the enemy \u201cKlangeist\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disc manipulated by BrebeMan is an offensive and defensive tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times it is a blade that slices the enemy, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and at other times it is a shield that protects you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you accumulate tension, you can &quot;change the beat&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Change the Beat&quot; attacks all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful boss awaits you at the end of each stage. Face them with all your might.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music features a wide variety of club music styles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from classic to trendy, with drum'n'bass as the mainstay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive sounds that progress according to the game enhance the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with BrebeMan , various characters are represented in the collage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage, vaporwave, retro-futuristic,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and various other visuals invite you into an unknown world.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"WELCOME!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/36a6c6a1c6614f1b2e1be301701d773474f9288a.jpg"},{"name":"TEST COMPLETE.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/acacc9612fed619d264dcfa128304f5b56dd345f.jpg"},{"name":"First Step","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/5f4ba9587e36056a3f2d00ad292f5f6ad2245de0.jpg"},{"name":"DJ BATTLE!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/b1029c7347ef0db385fcb99fa92bde7126b0bf2c.jpg"},{"name":"Across the sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/72ff3d706a7a05ade554b22fb6a21f6499869cb6.jpg"},{"name":"Approval","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/a6c5642b558da8f13291e0ad48c04f4f5e851898.jpg"},{"name":"Heaven and Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/1b5c99dda1aac9d9d6c5dd251c9d64ff95bf8fa6.jpg"},{"name":"Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/f71c00f5460c4c3087640ef3c7b3f7f9208e047f.jpg"},{"name":"The Birth of a Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/0d7fda22fc2d6c9c3e78ec7d70fc63f8153c4485.jpg"},{"name":"Homecoming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3349980/de2057537e103cd320956d6f9db80c9f6342a84e.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349980?t=1770939187"